{"tool_name":"advanced-cell-classifier","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>Advanced Cell Classifier is a data analyzer program to evaluate cell-based high-content screens and tissue section images developed at the Biological Research Centre, Szeged and FIMM, Helsinki (formerly at ETH Zurich). The basic aim is to provide a very accurate analysis with minimal user interaction using advanced machine learning methods.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Advanced Cell Classifier is a data analyzer program to evaluate cell-based high-content screens and tissue section images developed at the Biological Research Centre, Szeged and FIMM, Helsinki (formerly at ETH Zurich). The basic aim is to provide a very accurate analysis with minimal user interaction using advanced machine learning methods.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-03-03T16:20:54+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-15T09:53:55+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":3579,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"1117f9ed-bd6e-436c-8f5e-f87563919ecd","url":"/taxonomy/term/3579"},{"target_id":3599,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"9452479a-42da-42cf-a214-898c8df8025c","url":"/taxonomy/term/3599"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":"","last_comment_timestamp":1487153279,"last_comment_uid":41,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Peter Horvath"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://www.cellclassifier.org/about-acc/"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4111,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3443","url":"/image-analysis"},{"target_id":4016,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image